   51:   }
   52: 
   53:   // ------------------------------------------------ Android (system grant)
   54:   //
   55:   // Without storage permission a path cannot see files the user granted,
   56:   // and file_picker would copy the whole video into the cache. Instead the
   57:   // video is played from its content:// URI; only the small side files are
   58:   // copied into a per-video cache folder, where the existing loaders
   59:   // (danmaku, subtitles, comments, cover) find them next to `mergedPath`.
   60: 
   61:   /// Picks one video file. Android grants no access to the files next to
