  128:   /// Picks the video of a folder (the largest video file, as on desktop)
  129:   /// and the side files written next to it by a LibrePili download or by
  130:   /// other tools: `librepili.json`, `cover.jpg`, `<base>.danmaku.xml` /
  131:   /// `<base>.xml`, `<base>.<lan>.srt`, `<base>.comments.json` and its
  132:   /// `comments_images/` folder.
